  "description": "YAML adapter for Fnode: parses YAML text to a Node with source locations and the original timestamp text, and prints it back. Built on Flexi.Yaml; runs on .NET, Fable JavaScript and Fable Python.",
  "id": "Fnode.Yaml",
  "isPrerelease": false,
